    "head_commit_message": "feat(native): seek's claims settled in rounds (spec 42 step 2)\n\nEvery seeker not yet placed proposes a slot on the pool against the\nclaims settled in earlier rounds; a proposal wins unless one with a\nhigher contest key lies within a body's breadth of it (settling.rs,\nfor step 3 to reuse). Losers propose again; after ROUNDS (3) the rest\npress toward the nearest slot. Claims are a flat grid, `within` is\ncallable from the pool, and a pick no longer clones its owned slots.\n\nOutcomes-changed: Decision 161, in a dense scrum a few more seekers press rather than aim in the tick a crowd forms and find a slot a tick later; slot choices differ where two seekers wanted the same one; no change where seekers don't contend\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1pU9ArkPDKD19NADw",
